    "A small product box is held toward the camera. Actual holding, qualitative smallness and camera-relative presentation remain selected properties, with no brand, contents or advertisement inferred. Root must select exact existing scopes/identity relations and qualitative smallness reference. Actual holder-box distinctness/part topology cannot be inferred merely from role names; full ownership/receiver proof remains pending.",
    "The actual table edge is used as a visual threshold in composition. This selects a frame function, not an actual doorway, participant access barrier or emotional boundary. Exact source application/edge part_of guard and its actual object_structure role support require a published relation contract and fresh review. Do not fabricate endpoint scalar, add an edge or hide structural meaning because scalar helper cannot encode it.",
    "A discreet earpiece functions as an authored communications cue. Its unobtrusive presentation and cue function remain selected without actual wearing, hearing, surveillance or successful communication. Root must select existing exact earpiece identity versus new device/design/introduction and actual unobtrusive presentation scope. No actual wearing owner or communication endpoint is supplied."
